WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.097
By the end of the module, you should be able to structure multi-step S Q L with common table expressions,

00:00:07.097 --> 00:00:14.302
trace a recursive query, choose the correct ranking function, analyze sequences with lag and the next-value function,

00:00:14.302 --> 00:00:20.392
and write explicit frames for running and moving calculations.

00:00:20.392 --> 00:00:25.832
You should also understand the difference between group by and partition by.

00:00:25.832 --> 00:00:28.982
The goal is not only to run the syntax.

00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:32.645
You should be able to explain the row meaning at every stage.
